@api = http://localhost:5001
@email = replace-with-your-private-email
@password = replace-with-your-private-password
@accessToken = paste-token-from-login
@refreshToken = paste-refresh-token-from-login

### Public reads remain public
GET {{api}}/api/tasks/search

### Register always creates Staff, even if an extra role is submitted
POST {{api}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"Grading Staff","email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Verify current account
GET {{api}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin only (Staff gets 403)
GET {{api}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Rotate; replace both stored tokens with the response
POST {{api}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{refreshToken}}"}

### Logout invalidates all account sessions
POST {{api}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{refreshToken}}"}
